      "impact": "A06 success manifests are raw Bytes(MaterializeTaskContext result), without _run_id/_test_name. verify_owned treats their a06-* labels as structured events and unconditionally rejects their owner fields before verify_a06. Valid A06/G01/G02 paths are unreachable.",
