      "impact": "Even after fixing raw classification, the returned manifest bytes are only required nonempty and lacking a literal plaintext marker. Both events may cite the same valid raw member in this test; target_path strings being different does not distinguish raw calls. The consumer does not parse actual manifest task_id/bundle_ref/input_manifest, does not bind initial source_artifact_id to the captured snapshot row, or bind deleted_artifact_id to the deletion row. These leave prior R4 raw-call substitution/exclusion requirements open.",
